  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div data-pjax=\"true\" data-test-selector=\"body-content\" data-view-component=\"true\"><p><em>To receive a notification when a new release is available, click on <strong>Watch &gt; Custom &gt; Releases</strong> at the top.</em></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>scrcpy v4.0</strong></p>\n<p>Changes since v3.3.4:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Migrate from SDL2 to SDL3 (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3224174742\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6216\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6216/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6216\">#6216</a>)</li>\n<li>Add flex display support (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4278223888\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6772\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6772/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6772\">#6772</a>)</li>\n<li>Add camera torch and zoom support (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3246511983\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6243\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6243/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6243\">#6243</a>)</li>\n<li>Enforce window aspect ratio (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4226110211\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6761\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6761/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6761\">#6761</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4283946196\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6774\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6774/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6774\">#6774</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"892365578\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/2317\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/2317/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/2317\">#2317</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"920114816\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/2387\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/2387/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/2387\">#2387</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1346825137\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/3460\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/3460/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/3460\">#3460</a>)</li>\n<li>Add --keep-active (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4330334039\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6792\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6792/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6792\">#6792</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4325096297\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6787\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6787/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6787\">#6787</a>)</li>\n<li>Add --background-color (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4386167906\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6807\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6807/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6807\">#6807</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2858529062\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/5855\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/5855/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/5855\">#5855</a>)</li>\n<li>Set default background color to dark gray (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4386167906\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6807\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6807/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6807\">#6807</a>)</li>\n<li>Display disconnected icon before closing (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3917481176\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6662\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6662/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6662\">#6662</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3898110110\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6651\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6651/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6651\">#6651</a>)</li>\n<li>Add F11 as fullscreen shortcut (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4285480609\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6777\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6777/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6777\">#6777</a>)</li>\n<li>Add Mod+q shortcut to quit (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4297248705\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6780\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6780/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6780\">#6780</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3825011910\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6612\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6612/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6612\">#6612</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix Meta Quest flickering (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2907636038\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/5913\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/5913/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/5913\">#5913</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix physical vs logical size confusion (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4278223888\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6772\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6772/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6772\">#6772</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix copy-paste on rooted device (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3231941903\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6224\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6224/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6224\">#6224</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix colorspace conversion issue (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"732419716\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/1868\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/1868/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/1868\">#1868</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix high CPU usage with audio silence decoded from OPUS (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4061130925\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6715\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6715/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6715\">#6715</a>)</li>\n<li>Add session metadata for the video stream (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3147338385\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6159\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6159/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6159\">#6159</a>)</li>\n<li>Respect video capabilities constraints (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4244882811\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6766\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6766/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6766\">#6766</a>)</li>\n<li>Set Windows console code page to UTF-8 (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3918289928\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6663\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6663/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6663\">#6663</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix support for device serial containing spaces (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3918289928\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6663\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6663/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6663\">#6663</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3918324537\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6664\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6664/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6664\">#6664</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1409770473\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/3537\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/3537/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/3537\">#3537</a>)</li>\n<li>Detect TCP devices provided by mDNS (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3918332465\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6665\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6665/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6665\">#6665</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3250435666\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6248\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6248/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6248\">#6248</a>)</li>\n<li>Keep Windows terminal open on error (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3923125136\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6667\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6667/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6667\">#6667</a>)</li>\n<li>Set MediaCodec KEY_PRIORITY and KEY_LATENCY to minimum values (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3933657973\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6670\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6670/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6670\">#6670</a>)</li>\n<li>Open the scrcpy window earlier (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3992143381\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6694\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6694/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6694\">#6694</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3743426206\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6546\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6546/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6546\">#6546</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix device rotation shortcut (<a data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/commit/5fedc79530672ae2b0df6ac7654d75a6f2e18ce3/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/commit/5fedc79530672ae2b0df6ac7654d75a6f2e18ce3\"><tt>5fedc79</tt></a>)</li>\n<li>Use optimal size alignment (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4181781102\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6746\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6746/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6746\">#6746</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2318460823\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/4949\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/4949/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/4949\">#4949</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3244137631\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6236\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6236/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6236\">#6236</a>)</li>\n<li>Add --min-size-alignment (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4181781102\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6746\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6746/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6746\">#6746</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix screensaver disabled unexpectedly without video playback (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4208088542\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6754\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6754/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6754\">#6754</a>)</li>\n<li>Add --no-window-aspect-ratio-lock (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4226110211\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6761\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6761/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6761\">#6761</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix rotation of square displays (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4264929088\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6770\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6770/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6770\">#6770</a>)</li>\n<li>Align the virtual display size (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4277384612\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6771\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6771/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6771\">#6771</a>)</li>\n<li>Add --render-fit (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4278223888\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6772\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6772/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6772\">#6772</a>)</li>\n<li>Set default audio-output-buffer to 10ms (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4283996948\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6775\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6775/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6775\">#6775</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1620318954\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/3793\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/3793/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/3793\">#3793</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix turning virtual display on via right-click (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4327504732\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6788\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6788/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6788\">#6788</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix OpenGL runner shutdown deadlock (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4344727487\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6794\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6794/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6794\">#6794</a>)</li>\n<li>Share SDL hints between normal and OTG modes (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4389577415\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6809\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6809/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6809\">#6809</a>, <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4387497236\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6808\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6808/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6808\">#6808</a>)</li>\n<li>Upgrade platform-tools (adb) to 37.0.0</li>\n<li>Upgrade FFmpeg to 8.1.1 (<a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4061130925\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6715\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6715/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6715\">#6715</a>)</li>\n<li>Upgrade SDL to 3.4.8</li>\n<li>Upgrade dav1d to 1.5.3</li>\n<li>Various technical fixes</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n\n<h2>Highlights</h2>\n<h2>SDL3</h2>\n<p>This release migrates from SDL2 to SDL3 to benefit from active maintenance, bug fixes, and continued upstream support. SDL3 also enables new features, such as aspect-ratio locking when resizing the window.</p>\n<p>Thanks to the SDL maintainers for their work and for their <a href=\"https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/issues?q=is%3Aissue%20(author%3A%40rom1v%20OR%20scrcpy)%20sort%3Acreated-desc\">support and fixes</a>!</p>\n<p>See <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3224174742\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6216\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6216/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6216\">#6216</a> for details.</p>\n<h2>Flex display</h2>\n<p>A virtual display can now be made <em>flex</em> using <code>--flex-display</code> (or <code>-x</code>), meaning it can be resized dynamically along with the client window.</p>\n<p>Here is a demo:</p>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"scrcpy --new-display=/192 -x --start-app=org.mozilla.firefox --keep-active --no-vd-system-decorations\"><pre>scrcpy --new-display=/192 -x --start-app=org.mozilla.firefox --keep-active --no-vd-system-decorations</pre></div>\n<details open=\"\"> <summary> <span>scrcpy-flex-display-2.mp4</span> <span></span> </summary> <video src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/543275/587962062-0822bcf7-58c1-4106-87f6-c8089c08a777.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3Nzg2Njk1MzEsIm5iZiI6MTc3ODY2OTIzMSwicGF0aCI6Ii81NDMyNzUvNTg3OTYyMDYyLTA4MjJiY2Y3LTU4YzEtNDEwNi04N2Y2LWM4MDg5YzA4YTc3Ny5tcDQ_.yJwaVX4eaqifm2FNBzkyfm8YcBgKqAqmbw1Q_g7z9lk\" data-canonical-src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/543275/587962062-0822bcf7-58c1-4106-87f6-c8089c08a777.mp4?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3Nzg2Njk1MzEsIm5iZiI6MTc3ODY2OTIzMSwicGF0aCI6Ii81NDMyNzUvNTg3OTYyMDYyLTA4MjJiY2Y3LTU4YzEtNDEwNi04N2Y2LWM4MDg5YzA4YTc3Ny5tcDQ_.yJwaVX4eaqifm2FNBzkyfm8YcBgKqAqmbw1Q_g7z9lk\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\"> </video>\n</details>\n\n<p>Here are more examples:</p>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# Start Android Settings in a window\nscrcpy --new-display=1024x768/160 --start-app=com.android.settings --flex-display\n\n# -x is equivalent to --flex-display\nscrcpy --new-display=1024x768/160 --start-app=com.android.settings -x\n\n# By default, the display size/dpi is 1280x960/160\nscrcpy --new-display --start-app=com.android.settings --flex-display\"><pre><span><span>#</span> Start Android Settings in a window</span>\nscrcpy --new-display=1024x768/160 --start-app=com.android.settings --flex-display\n\n<span><span>#</span> -x is equivalent to --flex-display</span>\nscrcpy --new-display=1024x768/160 --start-app=com.android.settings -x\n\n<span><span>#</span> By default, the display size/dpi is 1280x960/160</span>\nscrcpy --new-display --start-app=com.android.settings --flex-display</pre></div>\n<p>Use <code>--keep-active</code> to prevent the screen from turning off (see below):</p>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"scrcpy --new-display -x --keep-active\"><pre>scrcpy --new-display -x --keep-active</pre></div>\n<p>Increase the bit rate and/or change the codec to maintain good quality even with large windows:</p>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"scrcpy --new-display -x --video-codec=h265 -b16M\"><pre>scrcpy --new-display -x --video-codec=h265 -b16M</pre></div>\n<p>See <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4278223888\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6772\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6772/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6772\">#6772</a> for more details.</p>\n<h2>Camera torch and zoom</h2>\n<p>The camera can be controlled dynamically:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><kbd>MOD</kbd>+<kbd>t</kbd>: turn on the camera torch</li>\n<li><kbd>MOD</kbd>+<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>t</kbd>: turn off the camera torch</li>\n<li><kbd>MOD</kbd>+<kbd>↑</kbd> <em>(up)</em>: zoom in</li>\n<li><kbd>MOD</kbd>+<kbd>↓</kbd> <em>(down)</em>: zoom out</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The camera torch can also be turned on at startup by <code>--camera-torch</code>:</p>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"scrcpy --video-source=camera --camera-torch\"><pre>scrcpy --video-source=camera --camera-torch</pre></div>\n<p>The camera zoom level can be set with <code>--camera-zoom</code>:</p>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"scrcpy --video-source=camera --camera-zoom=1.5\"><pre>scrcpy --video-source=camera --camera-zoom=1.5</pre></div>\n<p>The supported zoom range for each camera is given by <code>--list-cameras</code> (any value outside the supported range will be clamped).</p>\n<h2>Aspect ratio</h2>\n<p>Previously, the window could be freely resized, and black borders were added to maintain the content aspect ratio.</p>\n<p>Thanks to a new API in SDL3, the window aspect ratio is now preserved while resizing, avoiding black borders.</p>\n<p>The old behavior can be restored using <code>--no-window-aspect-ratio-lock</code>.</p>\n<h2>Keep active</h2>\n<p>To prevent the device from turning off due to inactivity, <code>--keep-active</code> periodically signals user activity to the system:</p>\n\n<p>Contrary to <a href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/blob/master/doc/device.md#stay-awake\"><code>--stay-awake</code></a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/blob/master/doc/device.md#screen-off-timeout\"><code>--screen-off-timeout</code></a>, this does not change any global settings, and it works whether the device is plugged in or not.</p>\n<h2>Background color</h2>\n<p>The default background was pure black; it is now dark gray.</p>\n<p>It can be changed with <code>--background-color</code>, which accepts hexadecimal color codes (in 3-digit or 6-digit format):</p>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"scrcpy --background-color=#234567\nscrcpy --background-color=234567  # leading '#' is optional\nscrcpy --background-color=#567 # equivalent to #556677\"><pre>scrcpy --background-color=<span><span>#</span>234567</span>\nscrcpy --background-color=234567  <span><span>#</span> leading '#' is optional</span>\nscrcpy --background-color=<span><span>#</span>567 # equivalent to #556677</span></pre></div>\n<h2>Disconnected icon</h2>\n<p>When the connection to the device is lost while mirroring, the window previously closed immediately, which could incorrectly suggest that scrcpy had crashed.</p>\n<p>To make disconnections clearer, a disconnected icon is now displayed for 2 seconds before closing the window.</p>\n<p>The icon replaces the screen content immediately:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/543275/553756336-3b97ec67-814b-423c-b1dd-5c75036e93c5.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3Nzg2Njk1MzEsIm5iZiI6MTc3ODY2OTIzMSwicGF0aCI6Ii81NDMyNzUvNTUzNzU2MzM2LTNiOTdlYzY3LTgxNGItNDIzYy1iMWRkLTVjNzUwMzZlOTNjNS5wbmc_._xVWaedK8poSHnGeAqwHzTzvN11f2pEkGbgff4bdrXw\"><img width=\"230\" height=\"512\" alt=\"scrcpy_disconnected_2_small\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/543275/553756336-3b97ec67-814b-423c-b1dd-5c75036e93c5.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3Nzg2Njk1MzEsIm5iZiI6MTc3ODY2OTIzMSwicGF0aCI6Ii81NDMyNzUvNTUzNzU2MzM2LTNiOTdlYzY3LTgxNGItNDIzYy1iMWRkLTVjNzUwMzZlOTNjNS5wbmc_._xVWaedK8poSHnGeAqwHzTzvN11f2pEkGbgff4bdrXw\" content-type-secured-asset=\"image/png\"></a></p><p>More details in <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3917481176\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6662\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6662/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/pull/6662\">#6662</a>.</p>\n<h2>Meta Quest</h2>\n<p>Since a Meta Quest firmware upgrade, flickering occurred when mirroring the screen with scrcpy.</p>\n<p>A workaround was implemented, so mirroring a Meta Quest now works again.</p>\n<p>See the technical details in <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2907636038\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/5913\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/5913/hovercard?comment_id=3677889916&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/5913#issuecomment-3677889916\">#5913 (comment)</a>.</p>\n<h2>High CPU usage with silence</h2>\n<p>A funny bug: playing silence used much more CPU than playing non-silence, during resampling of audio samples decoded from an OPUS audio stream (resampling was about 40× slower).</p>\n<p>It turns out it was caused by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Subnormal_number\" rel=\"nofollow\">denormals</a>: the OPUS decoder did not produce exact <em>zeros</em>, but tiny denormal numbers, which can cause <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Subnormal_number#Performance_issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">performance issues</a>.</p>\n<p>This was fixed directly in FFmpeg: <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4061130925\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6715\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6715/hovercard?comment_id=4061462344&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/issues/6715#issuecomment-4061462344\">#6715 (comment)</a></p>\n<h2>More shortcuts</h2>\n<p><kbd>F11</kbd> now toggles fullscreen (like <kbd>MOD</kbd>+<kbd>f</kbd>), and <kbd>MOD</kbd>+<kbd>q</kbd> now quits scrcpy.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li>BlueSky: <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/scrcpy.bsky.social\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>@scrcpy.bsky.social</code></a></li>\n<li>Twitter: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scrcpy_app\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>@scrcpy_app</code></a></li>\n<li>Reddit: <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/scrcpy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>r/scrcpy</code></a></li>\n</ul></div></div>",
